     <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level0\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">currency <span>(string)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Kod waluty zgodny z ISO 4217 Przykład: PLN, EUR</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"numberOfAdults\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level0\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">numberOfAdults <span>(int)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Liczba dorosłych</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"numberOfBigChildren\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level0\">\n                        <strong class=\"\">numberOfBigChildren <span>(int)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>liczba dzieci, które według konfiguracji sprzedaży mają inne ceny</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"language\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level0\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">language <span>(language)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>\n                    <span>Możliwe wartości:\n                    </span> (<i>eng, pol, ger</i>)</p><p></p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div></div>\n        <div id=\"api_method_response_json\" class=\"mb-5\"><div class=\"api_method_header px-3\"><div class=\"api_method_header_left d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center justify-content-sm-between align-items-center\"><div><i class=\"icon-code\"></i> \n            <strong>Struktura odpowiedzi</strong></div></div></div><div id=\"api_method_response_content\" class=\"api_details visible\">\n                <div class=\"api_details_item open\" data-parameter-name=\"errors\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level0 toggle\">\n                        <strong class=\"\">errors <span>(gateErrorType)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Lista kodów błędów</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        \n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"faultCode\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level1\">\n                        <strong class=\"\">faultCode <span>(int)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Kod błędu</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"faultString\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level1\">\n                        <strong class=\"\">faultString <span>(string)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Opis błędu</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div></div>\n                <div class=\"api_details_item open\" data-parameter-name=\"pricingOffers\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level0 toggle\">\n                        <strong class=\"\">pricingOffers <span>(pricingOffersArray)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p></p></span>\n                    </div>\n        \n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item open\" data-parameter-name=\"pricingOfferType\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level1 toggle\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\"> <span>(pricingOfferType)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>element typu pricingOfferType</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        \n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"objectId\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level2\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">objectId <span>(int)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Identyfikator przedmiotu rezerwacji</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"minimalPrice\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level2\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">minimalPrice <span>(float)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Cena minimalna</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item open\" data-parameter-name=\"offers\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level2 toggle\">\n                        <strong class=\"\">offers <span>(offersArray)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Lista dostępnych ofert</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        \n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item open\" data-parameter-name=\"offer\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level3 toggle\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\"> <span>(offer)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>element typu offer</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        \n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"name\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level4\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">name <span>(string)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Nazwa</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"offerType\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level4\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">offerType <span>(string)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Typ oferty</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"price\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level4\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">price <span>(float)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Cena</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"persons\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level4\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">persons <span>(int)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Liczba osób</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"promotionId\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level4\">\n                        <strong class=\"\">promotionId <span>(int)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Identyfikator promocji</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item open\" data-parameter-name=\"includedRateplanIds\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level4 toggle\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">includedRateplanIds <span>(includedRateplanIdsArray)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Identyfikatory planów cenowych</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        \n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"int\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level5\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\"> <span>(int)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>element typu int</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n        <div id=\"php-example_json\" class=\"code_example mb-5\"><div class=\"api_method_header px-3\"><div class=\"api_method_header_left d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center justify-content-sm-between align-items-center\"><div><i class=\"icon-file-code\"></i> \n            <strong>Przykład kodu w PHP</strong></div></div></div><div class=\"api_details visible\">\n                <div id=\"php-example_content_json\">\n                    <pre class=\"highlight-code hljs php\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">&lt;?php</span>\n\n$address = <span class=\"hljs-string\">'https://client1679.idobooking.com/api/public/pricingOffers/36/json'</span>;\n\n$request = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">array</span>();\n$request[<span class=\"hljs-string\">'objectIds'</span>] = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">array</span>();\n$request[<span class=\"hljs-string\">'objectIds'</span>][<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>] = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>;\n$request[<span class=\"hljs-string\">'dateFrom'</span>] = <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"dateFrom\"</span>;\n$request[<span class=\"hljs-string\">'dateTo'</span>] = <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"dateTo\"</span>;\n$request[<span class=\"hljs-string\">'currency'</span>] = <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"currency\"</span>;\n$request[<span class=\"hljs-string\">'numberOfAdults'</span>] = <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>;\n$request[<span class=\"hljs-string\">'numberOfBigChildren'</span>] = <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>;\n$request[<span class=\"hljs-string\">'language'</span>] = <span class=\"hljs-string\">'eng'</span>;\n\n$request_json = json_encode($request);\n$headers = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">array</span>(\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">'Accept: application/json'</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">'Content-Type: application/json;charset=UTF-8'</span>\n);\n\n$curl = curl_init($address);\ncurl_setopt($curl, CURLOPT_HTTP_VERSION, CURL_HTTP_VERSION_1_1);\ncurl_setopt($curl, CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER, <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>);\ncurl_setopt($curl, CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYPEER, <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">false</span>);\ncurl_setopt($curl, CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYHOST, <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">false</span>);\ncurl_setopt($curl, CURLOPT_FORBID_REUSE, <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>);\ncurl_setopt($curl, CURLINFO_HEADER_OUT, <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>);\ncurl_setopt($curl, CURLOPT_HEADER, <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>);\ncurl_setopt($curl, CURLOPT_POST, <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>);\ncurl_setopt($curl, CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS, $request_json);\ncurl_setopt($curl, CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER, $headers);\n\n$response = curl_exec($curl);\n$status = curl_getinfo($curl);\ncurl_close($curl);\n       </pre>\n                </div>\n            </div></div>\n        <div id=\"api_changelog_json\" class=\"mb-5\"><h2>Historia zmian</h2><p>W rozwiniętej historii metody nie wyświetlono wpisów zmian; dostępny był formularz porównywania wersji.</p></div></div></div></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        \n            \n        </div></div>",
